# EN: Sample requests. Open this file in Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client) and click "Send Request".
# AR: طلبات تجريبية. افتح هذا الملف في Visual Studio أو VS Code (REST Client) واضغط "Send Request".

@api = http://localhost:5080

### Check status (TCP) / فحص الحالة
GET {{api}}/api/terminal/status?transport=Tcp

### Check status (COM) / فحص الحالة
GET {{api}}/api/terminal/status?transport=Com

### Terminal ID (TCP only) / رقم الجهاز
GET {{api}}/api/terminal/id

### Merchant details (COM only) / بيانات التاجر
GET {{api}}/api/terminal/merchant

### Purchase 43.71 SAR / شراء
POST {{api}}/api/transactions/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 43.71, "transport": "Tcp" }

### Refund 0.50 SAR / استرجاع
POST {{api}}/api/transactions/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 0.50, "originalRrn": "434615455456", "originalDate": "2024-12-11", "transport": "Com" }

### Repeat last transaction / إعادة آخر عملية
POST {{api}}/api/transactions/repeat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transport": "Tcp" }

### Reconciliation / التسوية
POST {{api}}/api/reconciliation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transport": "Tcp" }

### Validation error example: 3 decimals -> 400 / مثال خطأ تحقق
POST {{api}}/api/transactions/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1.005 }
